{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36194","headline":"书桃花坞周处士壁 · 方干","name":"书桃花坞周处士壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"醉吟雪月思深苦，思苦神劳华髪生。\n自学古贤修静节，唯应野鹤识高情。\n细泉出石飞难尽，孤烛和云湿不明。\n何事嬾於嵇叔夜，更无书札答公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}